//
// Polish inflects and a quoted identifier does not, so the prose puts a noun in
// front of the token («stała <code>CLEAR_MARGIN</code>») and the <code> gate
// stays byte-identical. The hidden .gloss-variants rows list the case forms the
// prose actually uses, read off this table's own text.
//
